@startuml
title Sequence Diagram UC-08 Menolak Laporan
autonumber
actor "Admin Polres" as adm
boundary "RejectReportDialog" as dlg
control "VerificationService" as ver
entity "RejectionReason" as als
entity "Report" as lpr
entity "Incident" as kjd
entity "StatusHistory" as rws
control "NotificationService" as ntf
note over adm : 1–2. Admin menekan Tolak; dialog menampilkan perubahan status dan pilihan alasan.
adm -> dlg : tekan Tolak
dlg -> ver : GET /api/rejection-reasons
ver -> als : list()
ver --> dlg : reasons[]
note over adm : 3. Admin memilih alasan, boleh menambah catatan, lalu Ya, tolak laporan.
adm -> dlg : pilih alasan, Ya, tolak laporan
dlg -> ver : POST /api/reports/:id/reject {reasonId, note?}
alt 3a / 3b. alasan kosong, atau 'Lainnya' tanpa catatan
ver --> dlg : 422 minta alasan/catatan
end
ver -> kjd : lockByReport(id); status aktif?
alt 1b. status akhir (REJECTED / RESOLVED)
ver --> dlg : 409 Laporan sudah diproses
else aktif (RECEIVED, VERIFIED, ASSIGNED, IN_PROGRESS)
note over adm : 4. Sistem menyimpan alasan, mengubah status (juga laporan ganda), mencatat riwayat, menutup tiket.
ver -> lpr : save reason, note
ver -> kjd : applyStatus(REJECTED) [4a]
ver -> kjd : close()
ver -> rws : record(STATUS, REJECTED, admin)
note over adm : 5. Notifikasi berisi alasan ke Warga, Operator Polsek, dan Petugas Instansi penerima Penerusan [1a].
ver -> ntf : send(reporters, reason) + sector operators + dispatched officers
ver --> dlg : 200 updated report
end
note over adm : 6. Halaman menampilkan status Laporan Ditolak. 3c: Batal menutup dialog tanpa permintaan ke API.
dlg --> adm : tutup dialog, tampilkan status
@enduml
